{"3227500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blades of Mirage", "steam_appid": 3227500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Combat Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Mira, your survival relies on total weapon mastery. Combine distinct weapon classes to create unique combos and customize your loadout with powerful runes. Master precise skill execution, calculated timing, and absolute commitment to every strike and dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.poster.avif?t=1788249914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.webm?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.mp4?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the World of Legends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through stylized landscapes inspired by Southeast Asian archipelagos and mythologies. Carve your way through lush jungles, winding rivers, dark caves, and active volcanoes as you try to find ancient ruins that hold sacred relics and the secrets of forgotten tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.poster.avif?t=1788249914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.webm?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.mp4?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confront the Corrupted Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss encounter is a punishing test of skill and resilience. Face mythical legends guarding sacred relics, where a single misstep can prove fatal. Learn their attacks and adapt your playstyle to counter them. Your victory comes from calculated timing and strategic use of your chosen runes and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/c293b4d783509fb5e66eabd9c81a55e8.poster.avif?t=1788249914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/c293b4d783509fb5e66eabd9c81a55e8.webm?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/c293b4d783509fb5e66eabd9c81a55e8.mp4?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Combat Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Mira, your survival relies on total weapon mastery. Combine distinct weapon classes to create unique combos and customize your loadout with powerful runes. Master precise skill execution, calculated timing, and absolute commitment to every strike and dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.poster.avif?t=1788249914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.webm?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/83990b853e8adfbddd42f6e6f219b120.mp4?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the World of Legends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through stylized landscapes inspired by Southeast Asian archipelagos and mythologies. Carve your way through lush jungles, winding rivers, dark caves, and active volcanoes as you try to find ancient ruins that hold sacred relics and the secrets of forgotten tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.poster.avif?t=1788249914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.webm?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227500/extras/3aff12cef002c0a4bd1dad483c7f107b.mp4?t=1788249914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confront the Corrupted Guardians</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss encounter is a punishing test of skill and resilience. Face mythical legends guarding sacred relics, where a single misstep can prove fatal. Learn their attacks and adapt your playstyle to counter them. Your victory comes from calculated timing and strategic use of your chosen runes and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_